Stage 5 update:
- Added token verification middleware to validate JWTs for protected routes and attach user info to requests.
- Protected endpoint GET /protected/profile now returns profile data when a valid token is presented.
- Improved logout handling to clear sessions/tokens and added basic tests.
- Updated Swagger documentation (see stage4-swagger.png) and README.
